        <mxCell id="note_loop" parent="1" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=4;spacingRight=4;overflow=hidden;rotatable=0;rounded=0;fontSize=11;labelBackgroundColor=none;sketch=1;curveFitting=1;jiggle=2;" value="&lt;b&gt;PPO Loop (RLinf Quickstart):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Rollout: policy generates trajectories in ManiSkill3&lt;br&gt;2. Compute rewards + advantages via GAE&lt;br&gt;3. Update policy with clipped surrogate objective&lt;br&gt;4. Sync updated weights to rollout model copy&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Key:&lt;/b&gt; OpenVLA tokenizes actions as 256-bin discrete tokens&lt;br&gt;(same as language tokens). PPO operates on the token logits." vertex="1">
